type: software
version: "d2ai-camera-ready"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lzbaclz/KVSalienceBench"
url: "https://github.com/lzbaclz/KVSalienceBench"
abstract: >
  Artifact for an empirical audit of KV-saliency prediction, accepted to D2AI at
  IEEE ICDM 2026 (DM2158). Contains version-2 and historical experiment records,
  analysis code, tests, a pinned simulator bundle, a physical-KV reference validator,
  paper sources and an English presentation. Masked-loop task-quality findings do
  not imply production serving efficiency. Source datasets and model weights are
  obtained separately. Zenodo DOI registration is deferred to the authors.
keywords:
  - KV cache
  - attention prediction
  - empirical audit
  - physical validation
license: Apache-2.0
